   Park, Sang Hee; Lee, Pyoung Jik, Univ Liverpool, Sch Architecture, Acoust Res Unit, Liverpool, Merseyside, England.
   Jeong, Jeong Ho, Fire Insurers Labs Korea, Fire Safety \& Bldg Environm Syst Res Team, Yeoju Si, Gyeonggi Do, South Korea.},
